 "variants": null,
 "_note": "STM32F030F4P6, TSSOP20 as the classroom breakout (DIP-20 pin walk). Pin table from ST DS9773 Table 11. vss/vdd are named gnd/vcc (the engine bare-chip convention); vcc2 is VDDA (pin 5), tied to the same 3.3 V rail on the breakout. ADC_IN0-7 on pa0-pa7; TIM3 PWM channels on pa6/pa7/pb1 (AF1); USART1 on pa9/pa10. 3.3 V part \u2014 never wire the 5 V rail to vcc.",
